# The main ruleset requires a code owner review for these paths. Everything
# else (app code, tests, docs) can be merged by the boonze bot once CI is green.
#
# - .github/: CI, Dependabot and this file
# - scripts/: runs in the deploy job, which holds the ha-app deploy key and a
#   packages:write token
# - ha-app/: the app definition Home Assistant installs, including the app's
#   permissions on the Home Assistant host
# - Dockerfile: base image and build steps of the released image
/.github/   @Pelzebrummi
/scripts/   @Pelzebrummi
/ha-app/    @Pelzebrummi
/Dockerfile @Pelzebrummi
